{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 665,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:318977f6885e175d809f7d02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呜，呜呜……谢谢大家！！\\n唔喔喔喔喔──！我好高兴喔──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90dde3f4b605d57cddc9e4e2f0835bd0b1902da3199d11ff80fabc851aa9dfd5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "677"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0520142ec522910bd001fdcd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总觉得有股开心的感觉「碰──！！」地\\n突然涌上来……呃～我不太会形容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba329a092f448f38a4a70e004e3c2f40ca27ad4c32647b5f2658ff9189301009",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "678"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c6dd4ac8068b67aa224a17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……嗯，还不错啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "931a08864e641f4ae9379b77c46cc5b372d490e96277766f9a267134182be721",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "679"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff697502b395aff1fae38c50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哪有什么秘密！\\n就是靠爸妈给我的强韧双脚啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12c023099f99930c2f7951e7b73200f3a53dbe8c38a204513f076d34a7772dd7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "68"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5933fb106c628491bbf6842",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也没有什么话需要再说的啦……\\n反正你之后也一定会跟过来对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a98e13de099e52467d9be312780d734239688f671729707b34e84fc0aa1c160",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "680"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f3231dc48de98c163842abe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要举办先前就已经规划好的庆功宴。因为相信\\n能办得成，所以有同时进行了准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1e2aa37b1b57b76e09aaf01c6bad848da07609c41a1ca217b0568cc2e72413",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac7f3b4ab09d99cbdf6332f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正因为有你的指导，才让我能顺利\\n完成了这份计划……Danke schön！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f82ec70728dbd8d290f73e10ae97b1f9436e20a19100998f1808f5d55b1772b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "682"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9118b1b75cd3e900e3120c5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为用一句话完全不足以表达\\n真机伶的感谢之意……所以后续请见UG☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9261402a6d792c1c2c0024d9a6518404be0fd46c72d255916d0e630122d606fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "683"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:437e6ab5c430fa57dd8f2191",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸嘿♪因为真机伶今后会越来越可爱，\\n所以……不可以眨眼喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "734f71b671a3b5fa3e48280b44be199230be08d848d7a3e7db5c46a736d19215",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "684"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecff355648572e44c0956b56",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将来会和王子住进有练习赛道的城堡里……\\n咦？你不是要问这个？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cec3d90764b2898cb7af7f97f4bf6329a2aba281a04c9a8029c0afc213e6c2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "685"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bd655bea33e7596a1d25930",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还用问吗？那当然是──\\n友情、努力和毅力啰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e45bb05ce695188e6663b05509bc1d6142330bd77416e17f7347155976ce7bcd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "686"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c55bc3e142b38ffafd6a69a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，怎么办……呼，遇到这种真的很开心的\\n时刻，反而就是会说不出话来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "286e1cf9eaa4b06df981690dafa99f9c77f157f8b4edb7f87db848146911a48a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "687"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f89384425d5ccab2ce0998ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵……可以啊。不过要认真拍喔？\\n你会拍出一张最棒的照片对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da12c5276e36bfc256bcaf35a23421e6cd90612fdc96ca0ab54b97a6a051ebef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "688"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b90002995b04b796133c8626",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "爆进、爆进、再爆进！！\\n这就是最佳的模范式作战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca8581fa76139219bd48342effc93a5dfd37a04a3d4529886c1f346972717550",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "689"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e66555453a1bd9faa66c4b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呃！！是什么啊……！？\\n我跑得太过投入，结果都忘光了──！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61321dcc8e60b2fe4531d5bd6148c9430a49121d245af515465756ede6c6783e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "69"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab3e8fe791b88d087479bcc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我今后会持续响应大家的期待！\\n因为我是大家的班长！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb1797d38d8e21cced8224b1c7ff3519e37a95e29adde88a2d71cd921ad1601",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "690"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f37e1dcc268287159c4b3c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Of course，采珠狂欢祭就要开始啰。\\n何时？现在！let's dance!!",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05299c9e9b811a806da1e3cb909e6cc365d76ea9b649727c2f22413d217beaf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4f7cf64757b14715ad77ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "──看到了吧？世界转变的瞬间。\\n好了，接下来轮到你啰，现在开始冲刺吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "819e005d013ffc116431a3beca6274f003738405ce8eb42584903c515b856057",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "692"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628bfb29be27d7cf48055ad6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "风风要让所有粉丝都看到！\\n大家一起赞颂风风吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae4214035e5c51905d870f0c02f1da4d469ff07853268134d611f45bd190a4f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "693"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:986a00085903496c2ff2ca0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "风风想要三个人一起吃庆祝胜利的汉堡排啦！\\n而且要妈妈最拿手、最有嚼劲的那种！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76784744ffeb64534aed1ab70f366aac1cb1b4d075d9dae3c5e79fcdda1ccca2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "694"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e850896a450ae802033263c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对吧对吧！？哼哼──♪\\n我成为大魔女的日子就快到了喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5117d3e43db8f3b1b846cc748e58e4a7e5270b8bcf66d19fd9e1cbb72cec4ef5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "695"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02f34aa920d5468fa784e98d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "祖母，我赢了喔！妈妈，你看见了吗！？\\n爸爸……去买新的魔导书给我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25f92fb5ce6aff03148f5f11c68a6ff628d708d52ee6ef4f1d49940627a8abfc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "696"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f94f71b169cbae8cdb036dc9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊，我摸着大家的头说「好棒好棒」了♪\\n因为有大家的努力才会有这场胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "674630dd79157e5bc2953473110a0b7436aaa9780ee16d17cb0463629d25843e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "697"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccf3831ac8b6eda97f7682b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很高兴能由我来证明了\\n你真的是个「很棒的孩子」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "237791b3c620d1c0ebda13646e5ae8f41be6840fd5c362f61dbbf480635dc484",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "698"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac205302beb03757cb545bd1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子……会把心中满满的感谢之情，\\n全都投注在之后的演唱会上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e26834cef5ad3b1fd70e2a172fcbcc85a6a14ebd8da4e5a34b655f04646ee11a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "699"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a846741678bc07509bdbb77e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没错！我最爱的就是先来一道时髦的意大利面，\\n最后再用奶冻当甜点做收尾喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9578f46067799ed5492cab3b33deb3bab4356ca34bc9f29ce9a30b4efaa9f344",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8418faec79799d0946a02a9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大概是多亏训练员在竞赛之前，\\n对我说了「放轻松」的缘故吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a624bf08c1f34c5bddb18ee73c33b7524e4817851b2c3ae52cf7b4ca28046d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "70"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7d26ff27f26c3675694a55f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘偶像飞鹰子会用超全力载歌载舞！\\n所以请大家要声援飞鹰子超全力抵达终点喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "39e4f8b9dbdb8a53ddf51b3d6628c6ebce448a8dde85a4d3b52a84a7d1d94d5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "700"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18deef086c0afc32c17ceae7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦、咦咦！？我、我想想喔……\\n「超越王道成为传说」……的「序章」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "925586e90fe4f3c4000bddae8a5495b0aea3b59e3d15d2f6e167d65749c464b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31dc10ffad37ad54691101b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然都是一些很像英雄的人……不过，\\n今天，唯独今天！我才是、主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6dc1537041fa2f909d62333c180104e1be0fed5a67bb053ca340dbe6ceefb2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "702"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc584753b22e8b56d41d1504",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "糟糕！超开心，是说情绪太嗨了吧！\\n怎么办！？只要比个「YA」就可以了吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca969ee5458c354da31c4683cfdf46c6a723aa34f61c4cd26cf166fdc0cb064",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "703"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5050cd7e9070d086553547f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真心感谢～！啊，是说我想把这段采访\\n传到Umatok上耶，可以吗～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69df43b8f45d6398df7ba7828043d826ec3b5f48151f397805775fbb8dfc6cff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "704"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:435d28aabe5b15f7f18d4d98",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊，非胜即败的极限对决……\\n我玩得很尽兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6aaf110b3f166d5cf77bacb47ebe4079e1c9dc197faadca537c522b16f74607",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "705"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:559dc44fd83865df75c0d679",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………谁知道。\\n反正都会自己看比赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d2debdf0393e881f13979d2f4ccc7beaf14d1b162a451e8f0920a6cde14e4f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "706"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184407aa717a2fa1ebccb84a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "老实说会觉得你们都是怪人耶。\\n……看吧。我就是只能说出这种话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a2ad1c635d73f3b57b6e59fac9d6dbfed9b46aa9f50387fa1c7b5e435b607ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "707"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d993ed9fbc9501c3bdf651a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然……我不打算特别做些什么，但身边的人\\n一定会盛大庆祝吧……唉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc61367402f07be7ff2e1d4870838bd6d9cab822d7d20935d42a93a674ee80b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "708"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45cb0d026c6fc7e38692375e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会和队伍里的大家一起举办庆功宴，\\n这次我想挑战看看气泡果汁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d0e796f162eec80bf96467887781d7744406c18500645b7f6daba1e9311c64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "709"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:015df9dfae225cddfaf6274b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一定要有降噪功能……是说比起一直用同款，\\n随时确认有无最新款才是我的信条。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d755330d389d3701fc8246191aa3ee53044c320300197a10e10527d42b5d3d9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "71"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f943948dde00544b40a612fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的目标是和大家一起同乐！\\n谢谢你们让我看到了美好的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba659fd86f509e81feea84c03f59899d5811166675c7896c94f8439d410cb13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "710"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377f2ef404e1433867a3f9f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟你说喔！我觉得暖呼呼、头昏昏的，\\n有种「哇──」的感觉！想一直一直跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ede3a93f3e3dac30e06b77e6fc38e92bacd167559b1e77ebf9bdc23cc4a1fef6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "711"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46b08ed8d00b57346f72431e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我现在超级开心的喔！\\n谢谢你让我参加好多竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3babd2b985a36264e8e11f64355267134cfb6f3878887fa3c13ae89f08c5a6cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "712"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45ee31d426b0390d4b9aa79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最想先跟爸爸和训练员分享！\\n然后是妈妈跟教官……还有大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c03531727b149ffd929cd27a52e8582bf75d107494fa60f6642998b0f26f1903",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "713"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1022d9daea3a1b03bbc364",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让我体验到最热血的对决……真的很感谢！！\\n我们是永远的劲敌喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93146f069b3214b03063b3d7259a3a49b139d6f60088b7947f5ac0daacb37d3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "714"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722c7cae5ee84fda5b277b09",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "どんな苦境も、乗り越えてみせるっ！\\n正義のヒーローは、絶対に諦めないからな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f31ca8736732715051e1170cf4ff3f401bfd0dbf4a8dfe88db86f05cfb0a61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "715"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dd5c2148237eee596535488",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "愛と勇気と栄養を力に！\\nビコーペガサスの戦いは続く！　……へへ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "610261814c8704ddb3ac87e0ad88f0fe47de6d01484a5a907eef7aaaef1f099a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "716"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb45b2fb8ec386c87bb789d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "世界变得更可爱了对吧？\\n这就是竞赛！这就是美丽☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "826f8dcdd465a5b20a79662a1a1518ea872da2fe8b051ee7dd1bbfddfca68cdd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "717"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44da2c7fbfae7eb2d15b258c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不是喔！这还只是刚开始！\\n我要让世界变得更加美丽哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f134bfeda70b06221674ce5ef1ab4e4770b7a7b1d969195766f580f8b399aba0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "718"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c05af054e7d1eb427c7925d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "笑家门～～～～！！呵、呵、呵！！\\n就是这样，你很懂嘛～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6751b23efc40c486e4a5632dde28a840e7a84fe5e1b98e6393d2fa6e133404",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "719"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3097c491adb0c56d54f10308",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就如同我的计算。说完了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa4907120cc1c0bcafcbd547b45fbe65ead46189d1fa8b463544bf61f24dd2f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "72"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c07837e0ef43024324931584",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先要去还愿参拜！为了今后也能获得福报，\\n所以要确实地去向各路神明道谢喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35bb88e7bc5b77ae9e388a772ed25461628bf9f2df695b02c1f7932b00bfa6c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "720"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c117c2a5038a45cc3635b112",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，超棒的感觉！\\n你听见我雀跃不已的心跳声了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "093817d7761c1a29c9feea28e598e571aa474f1c502b510698b69a4122a7bca6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "721"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68da42e24c6242092016b734",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢你们的欢呼声。非常舒服！\\n如果愿意的话，再来观赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14e9f8a29b1e0623ebbae895e9a380a333aec825c686dde6f5f133db6de0910e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "722"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce2bc5249ac06dcad66c9670",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大、大家都好强……啊，要一句话……！\\n所以是……是、是我最强！？咦……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da1cdbe81decf618ce80696326315c6127223a71f07129dcfd5c51c5b50d0ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "723"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28e9619841393c3372843641",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我、我给训练员添了很多麻烦～！\\n……这样有稍微报答到训练员的恩情了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc9c76d4d47b862211b46de6725fbe91594fe84c9e0961f2f0721d28aea44b1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "724"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e3ad7616ebc6057ae4f137",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有的，能在这样的盛大舞台上响应\\n这么多人的期待……真的是太好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15c7be43ee3fd041e0573c0135b9eb0b391a769e27e8bf24ef38dfdeb214e62c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "725"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15d7e62a4ea00ad8c7cac388",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢你们愿意支持像我这种……不对！\\n谢谢你们……愿意相信并支持我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10324bd50627f16063dae0dded462b37efc493698fe7d2512fdff630daee54f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "726"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30d991e8e7467cdf4c7fbec5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈哈，该说是还有点无法置信吗，\\n又或是开心过头所以反而冷静下来的感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a95b5d4c306b0ef171b76d5bd3119ae74d5f5b1356934af9d25d8a97ee7d6447",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "727"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7bc02176ea9217096faa062",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然想说是因为运气，但还是算了。\\n因为我也用自己的方式尽力了……应该吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "65c8f23ff19a7d961bc2a66ee151a19f037fd3c648568fd969cea93a6bf25338",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "728"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5120a4fa70214c070a90295",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔～呵呵呵！理所当然的胜利！我完全\\n高兴到心浮气躁！因为是必然的结果！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "360eef8319aa7222bbc51e228e5db8a676a73ca9281d69adaf3a527ab3ea4276",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "729"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c94b7e7924a754d75e4294e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不，今天不吃蛋糕，\\n我正计划要等拿下决赛的胜利后再吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5242e8175e8d55dca8ff544b000997255bb60ec7df3e6a525469c138da94a6e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "73"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f49e5846730e592c4c208a13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔～呵呵呵！很好！我就赋予你\\n呼喊口号的权利！我的名字是？（以下略）",
      "source_fingerprint": "895005c69fa9dbf2847f80e077b317dba3d8566a1db7ce619818dea006ecb7ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "730"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4d9407e01a5cbcf38d7fb7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当时真的是不知道该怎么办……但我康复了、\\n参赛了、还获胜了！真是太好啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afda330808422a967b2bb195454c3a3e6731823913e592c763ae9b1c82ef2a6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "731"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f220ae59b4eeef336d5a4b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我还没浮现出什么真实感…………\\n啊呀呀！我赢了耶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c0ca08f7c16c3ba99b7aceabe638dfa91dae6f8ab02e3fcae209ffe5426334e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "732"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfe1b2bf49e645f629163aff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想定通りの結果。頭ではそう理解しているの\\nですが……いざ勝つと、嬉しいものですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e4c6febdc6c8db216e4fa2062e7574683e2d673367d396a9331035b4da9621",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "733"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a84986ec892e6fea885c82f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "そうですね……長く私を支え、応援して\\nくれる皆さんに捧げたいです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89cb4e32ade0a0a559eefdc714587b9e6b83d2fa110ae125295e544c79e547d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "734"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caaba4726db472b4e56e9c52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊……我为了见到这片景色而努力钻研……\\n不对！超感谢大家，你们最棒──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "320f940b023476679b94eb8979c7ef639513349196776749fce4473b060c092a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "735"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2f78bd74cf86311acff369",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "平时受你关照啦，训练员！\\n我证明了「善信」的实力有多强啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b43e5583c264a3e312dd923ad1ed3c6c060fc7494e02a9624b2fa8d09347a865",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "736"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4dea8adb33f20bed2d6e96e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔耶～☆结果最强的竟然是我自己啊！\\n神到自己都吓到了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc354826091a308640bfd97d4eececbc952e7cc035c238f99131b0d72ea2360",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "737"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b423cbd9bd43d44795f06a64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是先大声明，然～后～呢～用力狂欢！\\n……啊不过，我应该想先跟好姐妹说吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d6ec03016b09a2d1143861ea8d796be0e8bf625a50c18923b279bad6e8e1cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "738"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b56e96cccbfb9c090b67f9e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "涡轮还会再继续变得更强哦！\\n看好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d98608ba0c3d665f89b7118385d0db52834e2b4cae455088f1a92f1632a09fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "739"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b76c90231827a49a3a4b9c86",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有，竞赛对手的气势超出了我的预料。\\n所以我也燃烧得比原本预期的还要旺盛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fb77a59a1ecf2af5ff1f28265563466b98828028acbe1d0daee2e79d08c05d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb1c629544fbca09003db43e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奖励只要玩游戏就可以了！！\\n来多多对战几场吧，大玩特玩！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e628aa157ec143f11f6edf147c969cbd11e4669efb14dfb3d37aef1b39a9ea2a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "740"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c98a90aa9b39c90879472eb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不好意思，我现在没办法好好说话……\\n因为各种情绪涌现上来……我非常的开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83924c7e93ba261cdc5fb0f3a7ed013853855bafb52802c891c9455ea6b925a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff7af564e89312e4ccc70a90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然在竞赛的世界中，有时候也会附带苦难，\\n但今天就只有满满的美好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86522dde7323e397942b5d7da85bea9fe9724df9cbb9af4d565c5a7add484dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "742"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:392c78daad8681ff842997ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然我想向很多人报喜……但首先要告诉\\n在身旁支持我的训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "483c1b5cf4a013f3039e6aa90776b5556971aebb277cb61b8c871f8de718481a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "743"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9100007f3ba0c6e21482cb8d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喝啊～～～！！！接下来也要透过竞赛\\n和演唱会继续传播活力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e61dc5723e905199f778f91b6b9852ae1f5df40773e13ac574c47fa0de1ef5fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "744"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f54b8fafd65aa604ab40bc8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "实在感激不尽！接下来也要拜托你\\n多多照顾千代……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d016d1de41a2b6d21998e0a6c9f586595649d0223ca01c7ad1c9b70a350f04a2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "745"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbebe4cddf3929ba5725fa50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「今天的樱花是明天的樱饼」，我会将胜利\\n当作动力，继续朝梦想迈进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "482232df8f93b9f3938529b15a86fe97fafc7ab77fc202d293b9cdae58da5c52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "746"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1888e005e51e1983db70a105",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵，这简直是场为我而办的比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5851c001fa990c48b11208434e858463ac7f3cac444c7a4e8f3ac382847be4df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "747"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd164c9bbfb51c6672aa6b77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我也可以考虑赏你一个奖励吧。\\n就带你去散步好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e264dd84779bc50f5752f1df3b66c3a9f1c083ef4b01b75e8e0ab3ad93b124",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "748"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
